WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.078 --> 00:00:06.385
Announcements to members start under Library, Announcements. Add New starts one.

2
00:00:11.252 --> 00:00:15.390
The boxes are numbered, so just work down them. One is the message itself.

3
00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:29.100
Two is where it sends members. Here, the new course.

4
00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.009
Three is who gets it. Here, members with an active membership. Choose carefully.

5
00:00:38.902 --> 00:00:41.328
Four is delivery. For now, save a draft.

6
00:00:41.328 --> 00:00:44.966
Your destination and audience are kept, and nothing is sent.

7
00:00:48.062 --> 00:00:49.101
Five is the review.

8
00:00:49.101 --> 00:00:53.203
Preview the audience to see who would receive it, before anything goes out.

9
00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:06.221
Sending isn't switched on yet, so announcements stay as drafts.

10
00:01:06.221 --> 00:01:09.433
When it is, only deliver once the audience looks right.
